  "description": "gRPC transport binding for Orleans.Lattice.Api.Data. Exposes the read-write external data-plane API (set, delete, single-tree and cross-tree atomic batches, point read, bounded range read) as unary gRPC RPCs over a code-first, Orleans-serialized contract, with a header-based identity bridge, a pluggable coarse authorization seam, and a default-deny posture. Registered with AddLatticeDataApiGrpc(...) and mapped with MapLatticeDataApiGrpc().",
